<% content_for :title, "#{ui('Privacy')} · Rails 8 Face Recognition" %>
<%= render "shared/page_header", eyebrow: ui("Transparency"), title: ui("Privacy & data handling"), description: ui("A concise operational description of this research application, not a substitute for a jurisdiction-specific legal privacy notice.") %>
<div class="mt-8 space-y-5">
  <section class="panel p-7"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold"><%= ui('Purpose and access') %></h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400"><%= ui('Only authenticated members may upload an authorized, pre-cropped face image. Files are processed solely for a requested identity comparison against the synthetic reference gallery. User uploads are never automatically enrolled or used for training.') %></p></section>
  <section class="panel p-7"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold"><%= ui('Storage and retention') %></h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400"><%= ui('Uploads are kept in private object storage with a 24-hour expiry at submission time. A scheduled purge job removes expired submissions, associated embeddings and results; actual removal depends on the job runner and storage system operating correctly. You can also delete an upload manually at any time.') %></p></section>
  <section class="panel p-7"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold"><%= ui('Inference and security') %></h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400"><%= ui('Authorized image bytes are sent to the separately deployed inference endpoint configured by the administrator. Authentication tokens remain server-side. Private object previews use authenticated controller responses with no-store headers. Operational access is restricted by role.') %></p></section>
  <section class="panel p-7"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold"><%= ui('Your controls') %></h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400"><%= ui('Use your account dashboard to review and delete private uploads. Manual deletion removes associated recognition records and embeddings. The reset-test-data function clears your prior test activity without changing Core references. Contact the operator for account deletion and legal privacy requests.') %></p></section>
  <section class="panel p-7"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold"><%= t('auth.verify_email') %></h2><p class="page-description"><%= ui('Registration stores your email and a password hash. Verification and password-reset links are short-lived, email delivery is managed by the configured transactional provider, and login attempts are throttled using hashed IP/account fingerprints. Admins may suspend accounts and revoke sessions. Your temporary uploads can be removed from Reset test data.') %></p></section>
</div>
